    <!-- Main heading -->
    <h2>Best Globalesim Promo Codes for {{ buildMonthYear }}</h2>
    
    <!-- Introduction -->
    <p>Globalesim offers convenient eSIM plans across <strong>150+ countries</strong>. No physical SIM, no vendor hopping—just pick your destination, scan a QR, and you’re online. It’s middle-of-the-road pricing with solid reliability.</p>

    <!-- Key Features Highlight -->
