        <h2 style="color: #5D4037; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">What Makes Globalesim Stand Out?</h2>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem;">
            <div style="text-align: center; padding: 1rem;">
                <h3 style="color: #5D4037;">Global Plans</h3>
                <p>One eSIM covers multiple countries—great for regional trips</p>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: center; padding: 1rem;">
                <h3 style="color: #5D4037;">Flexible Validity</h3>
                <p>Plans range from 1 to 30 days to fit your trip length</p>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: center; padding: 1rem;">
                <h3 style="color: #5D4037;">Auto-Renewal Option</h3>
                <p>Can subscribe ahead to avoid run-outs — handy for longer travels</p>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: center; padding: 1rem;">
                <h3 style="color: #5D4037;">Support Email Help</h3>
                <p>Support via email—no live chat, but replies are decent</p>
            </div>
