    <!-- How Globalesim Works -->
    <h2>How Globalesim eSIM Works</h2>
    <p>Choose your destination or global region, buy your eSIM, get a QR code, and scan to install. Setup takes minutes, and you can monitor usage via your Globalesim account or mobile app.</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Pick country or regional global plan</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Buy online</strong> and receive QR instantly</li>
        <li><strong>Install anytime</strong>, activate when you land</li>
        <li><strong>Auto-renew or set reminder</strong> so you don’t run dry</li>
    </ul>

